    "Arrival, supplies and Docking Procedure\nAt **Customs Lounge**, talk to **Charles**. Read his optional MMO, systems critique, Great Frontier and ethics topics, then ask **Could your analytics help tune my tactical heuristics?** Accept his request for **2 Circuit Boards + 1 Focusing Lens** and a public-queue comparison. Leave the conversation, then use **biometric gates** to compare the public departures with Charles’s advertised waits; passenger records stay sealed. Confirm the comparison feedback and that the gates become gray inspection text. Carried materials count: you can return to Charles and finish the favor now if you already have both boards and the lens, or leave the material turn-in for step 214. This is a milestone favor, not one of the five Journal side quests.": "f2cffabc465faff6",
    "The Throne Room, armory and Soloist\nAt **Customs Lounge**, finish **Charles**’s favor if it is still pending. If you accepted it on an older save, leave the conversation and use **biometric gates** for the public-queue comparison first. Return with **2 Circuit Boards + 1 Focusing Lens**, select **I’ve brought the circuit boards and focusing lens for your network tap**, and finish the turn-in. Confirm those materials consumed, **Venture Heuristic Slate** received, 400 XP and 500 credits. Materials carried from earlier worlds are valid. The avionics vault supplies one board; the second board and lens depend on your earlier inventory/salvage. If you lack them, leave this favor pending and record it before departure; neither this route nor the local shop guarantees a fresh complete set. If you already completed the favor, expect no second reward or new audit requirement. Rest, cook, shop and save here before the final encounters.": "a93f0a62b18e1eed",
    "One-time discoveries and branch cache checklist\n- [ ] Charles’s analytics favor accepted, public queue verified and, if materials available, turned in for Venture Heuristic Slate; retain a pending-favor note otherwise.": "8b0a2405b77b9c4e"
  },
  "6": {
    "Orion’s nightmare, the Chorus and campfire memories\nFrom **The Campfire**, go **east** to **Blue Ash Circle** (`source_campfire_node_scale_01`) → **east** to **Silent Shore** (`source_orion_nightmare`). At **Silent Shore**, inspect **black ocean**, **Aethel note**.": "f1a49f18109922a9",
    "Mine memories and Jed’s Echo\nFrom **Source First Fear**, go **south** to **Manager Blind Spot** (`source_echo_mines_node_scale_04`) → **south** to **Shelter Plastic** (`source_echo_mines_node_scale_03`) → **south** to **Pay Stub Drift** (`source_echo_mines_node_scale_02`) → **west** to **Locker Row Loop** (`source_echo_mines_node_scale_01`) → **north** to **Echo of the Mines** (`source_echo_mines`). At **Echo of the Mines**, inspect **first shelter**, **mine checkpoint**.": "882b83ec08e3c80a"
  }
}
